{"id":"memorial_101703","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101700","label":"Memoirs · Letters from Girlfriend"},"label":"To J,","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101702","next":"memorial_101704","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101703_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_03_description","text":"I just saw the news today. So it is true..."},{"id":"memorial_101703_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_03_description","text":"I'm sorry for not believing you before, but none of this seems possible."},{"id":"memorial_101703_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_03_description","text":"When will you come back? I'm frightened."},{"id":"memorial_101703_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_03_description","text":"My family is preparing to evacuate."},{"id":"memorial_101703_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_03_description","text":"My mailing address will change, so don't reply to this letter."},{"id":"memorial_101703_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_03_description","text":"Contact me the moment you get your phone fixed."},{"id":"memorial_101703_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_03_description","text":"Guess we'll have to postpone our wedding until this is all over."},{"id":"memorial_101703_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_03_description","text":"I'll write to you soon. I love you always."}]}